ng \'Like a Rolling Stone\'?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Bob Dylan\u2019s 1965 single ran for more than six minutes, unusually long for a hit song at the time.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7a1a-9deb-1669c465a56d","description":"Bob Dylan","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7963-a7d9-dcee29cc221b","description":"Neil Young","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-74f7-9174-fe132aa3ddc2","description":"Tom Petty","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-74a0-b7da-db1be126c5e1","description":"Bruce Springsteen","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7063-98fc-a8ab0da5a980","category":"01a21312-b489-756b-b99b-37e1b385a482","question":"Which 1969 festival was held at Max Yasgur\'s farm?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Woodstock became a defining symbol of 1960s counterculture. Jimi Hendrix\'s performance of \u201cThe Star-Spangled Banner\u201d was one of the festival\'s best-known moments.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad41-786b-bcac-7a1f97958de0","description":"Woodstock","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-724d-bf84-3e2562381cbe","description":"Lollapalooza","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7bcb-86c4-9525c93511ab","description":"Bonnaroo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7fcb-9cff-adde9298525f","description":"Coachella","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7fe3-bd72-d6da32c68980","category":"01a21312-b489-756b-b99b-37e1b385a482","question":"What song did Haddaway have a hit with in 1993?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"What Is Love was featured prominently in the 1998 comedy A Night at the Roxbury, where characters bob their heads to it in a club.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7496-89ba-0146d4c7b776","description":"What Is Love","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7fa8-88bd-ba06ecf0781e","description":"It Takes Two","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-7beb-9acc-28107e1e1328","description":"Me And Mrs. Jones","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad41-782e-80b8-77